'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Issued on April 3, 2024, to all [[Helldiver]]s whose accounts existed prior to that date.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link to file] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref>

== Lore ==
Issued to all Helldivers in commemoration of their fallen comrades, on Malevelon Creek Memorial Day. A day serving as a reminder of all the 'divers who lost their lives in battles over [[Malevelon Creek|the Creek]], both during the {{MajorOrderLink|id=A1-2-1|text=opening weeks}} of the [[Galactic War#The Second Galactic War|Second Galactic War]] and the {{MajorOrderLink|id=A1-4-1|text=Liberation of Malevelon Creek}}.

